{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
HELP ME CHOOSE: GRID CARD
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
"Not sure which pack?" card that sits in the collection grid (main-collection "Help me choose" block) and opens the
Help me choose section. Without that section on the page, the button goes to the block's link.

* block: the main-collection block
* section: the main-collection section
* collection: the current collection
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign vb_link = block.settings.link | default: collection.url | default: request.path
  capture vb_style
    echo '--vb-launch-background: ' | append: block.settings.background | append: '; '
    echo '--vb-launch-text: ' | append: block.settings.text_color | append: '; '
    echo '--vb-launch-accent: ' | append: block.settings.accent | append: ';'
  endcapture
-%}

<div
  id="block-{{ section.id }}-{{ block.id }}"
  class="vb-hmc-launch"
  style="{{ vb_style }}"
  {% if block.settings.experiment_only %}data-vb-experiment{% endif %}
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <span class="vb-hmc-launch__icon" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="16.5"/><path d="M15.4 15.6a4.7 4.7 0 1 1 6.4 4.3c-1.1.5-1.8 1.5-1.8 2.7v1.1"/><circle cx="20" cy="28.6" r="0.9" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>
  </span>

  {%- if block.settings.title != blank -%}
    <p class="vb-hmc-launch__title">{{ block.settings.title }}</p>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
    <p class="vb-hmc-launch__text">{{ block.settings.text }}</p>
  {%- endif -%}

  <a class="vb-pill vb-pill--white" href="{{ vb_link }}#help-me-choose" role="button" data-vb-hmc-open="grid_card">
    {{- block.settings.button_label -}}
  </a>
</div>
